--- note
## What is NOT specified
The report does not disclose: dataset token counts, per-modality mixture ratios, number of training
steps, learning-rate schedule, or context length used during pre-training. Treat pre-training here as
"Gemma-3-like, multimodal, Jan-2025 cutoff, 262k SentencePiece vocab" and look to g412 for the compute
side.
